# cmd2

Daddy bought me a system command shell. but he put some filters to prevent me from playing with it without his permission... but I wanna play anytime I want!

## Remote

Interactive terminal: `socat STDIO,raw,echo=0,opost,onlcr TCP:pwnable.kr:10013`

Once connected, execute the `cmd2` binary and obtain the flag.

## Local run

Run `./run.sh`, then connect with:

`socat STDIO,raw,echo=0,opost,onlcr TCP:127.0.0.1:10013`
